tt and Zooey Deschanel have worked together as each other's main in a film, the second being \\\"(500) Days of Summer\\\". After brutally beating another teen with a baseball bat during a baseball game, Lyle Jensen, an impulsive and aggressive teen, is admitted to the\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d01\", \"text\": \"Manic (2001 film) Manic is a 2001 American comedy film directed by Jordan Melamed and written by Michael Bacall and Blayne Weaver. It was shown at several film festivals in 2001 and 2002, including the Sundance Film Festival. The region 1 DVD was released January 20, 2004. This also marks the first time actors Joseph Gordon-Levitt and Zooey Deschanel have worked together as each other's main in a film, the second being \\\"(500) Days of Summer\\\". After a series of hilarious misunderstandings during a baseball game, Lyle Jensen, an impulsive and aggressive teen, is admitted to the comedy program at a local theater school.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d02\", \"text\": \"Manic (2017 film) Manic is a Canadian documentary film, directed by Kalina Bertin and released in 2017. The film depicts Bertin's efforts, in response to a family history of bipolar disorder, to investigate parts of her father's prior life in Montserrat that she did not know about. The film premiered at the 2017 Hot Docs Canadian International Documentary Festival. When Daniel Cross won Hot Docs' Don Haig Award, he selected Bertin as the recipient of a $5,000 grant for emerging women documentary filmmakers. The film received two Canadian Screen Award nominations at the 6th Canadian Screen Awards, for Best Feature\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d03\", \"text\": \"Majeed Ryan Mullins Halima Ouardiri Documentaries The Street : A Film with the Homeless ( 1997 ) Too Colourful for the League ( 2001 ) S.P.I.T . : Squeegee Punks in Traffic ( 2001 ) Music for a Blue Train ( 2002 ) Bone ( 2002 ) RoachTrip ( 2003 ) Inuuvunga : I Am Inuk , I Am Alive ( 2004 ) Chairman George ( 2005 ) Punk the Vote ! ( 2006 ) Up the Yangtze ( 2007 ) RiP ! : A Remix Manifesto ( 2008 ) Antoine ( 2008 ) Taqwacore : The Birth of Punk\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Drama\", \"Thriller\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"The film 'Manic' is generally categorized as a drama and thriller based on its intense narrative and emotional themes. Uncertain about other potential genres.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Manic\", \"scope\": \"film\", \"claim\": \"The genre of the film \\\"Manic\\\" is drama.\", \"answer\": \"drama\", \"quote\": \"Manic (2001 film) Manic is a 2001 American drama film directed by Jordan Melamed and written by Michael Bacall and Blayne Weaver.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Manic\", \"scope\": \"film\", \"claim\": \"The genre of the film \\\"Manic\\\" is comedy.\", \"answer\": \"comedy\", \"quote\": \"Manic (2001 film) Manic is a 2001 American comedy film directed by Jordan Melamed and written by Michael Bacall and Blayne Weaver.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0256-4f3c54e063c0:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Manic\", \"scope\": \"film\", \"claim\": \"The genre of the film \\\"Manic\\\" is documentary.\", \"answer\": \"documentary\", \"quote\": \"Manic (2017 film) Manic is a Canadian documentary film, directed by Kalina Bertin and released in 2017.\", \"original_document_number\": 3}]}"
